<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁλῶα</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁλῷα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, τά, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλως</span>) festival of Demeter
		as inventress of agriculture, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>harvest home,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				2.834b
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				ii8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				59.116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philoch.
				161
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλωαῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλως</span>) <i>belonging to the
				threshing-floor:</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁλωαίη,</span> epith. of Demeter, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				41.5
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁλωάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁλωίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁλωαία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.155
			</span></i>.</div>
